.TH WERKMEISTER-WORKSPACE-PROMPT 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-workspace\-prompt \- Print the enclosing workspace's starting_prompt from workspace.yml
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister workspace prompt\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-start <dir>\fR
Directory to search up from (default: cwd)
.TP
\fB\-\-args\fR
Print the start_session arguments (title, model, prompt, background) as JSON instead
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Prints the enclosing workspace's \fBstarting_prompt\fR, for the starting\-prompt skill.
.SH EXIT CODES
.PP
1 when no \fBworkspace.yml\fR is found walking up from \fB\-\-start\fR; 2 when it has no \fBstarting_prompt\fR.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
